class: end-to-end
summary: a static Linux link of a program that loads a shared object through platform/posix is refused before any tool runs, naming the library routines that need the C library's loader and --link=libc
program: main.ldn
constructs: 1580, 1970, 1975
targets: linux-x86-64
expect: expected.txt
args: compile --target=linux-x86-64 --emit=exe --dry-run ../tests/fixtures/end-to-end/link-static-loads-a-library/main.ldn
status: 1
